NOTICE

This project is an independent Rust reimplementation of the pipeline of
RUAccent (https://github.com/Den4ikAI/ruaccent) by Denis Petrov, licensed
under the MIT License.

Model files (ONNX graphs, tokenizers, dictionaries) are produced by the
RUAccent project and distributed via https://huggingface.co/ruaccent/accentuator
(MIT). The `pack` tool builds a redistributable model directory with a
manifest recording SHA-256 checksums and upstream license notices; no model
files are stored in this repository.
